{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001959","compactId":"SO_0001959","id":"SO:0001959","label":"TCT_motif","definition":{"text":"A cis-regulatory element, conserved sequence YYC+1TTTYY, and spans -2 to +6 relative to +1 TSS. It is present in most ribosomal protein genes in Drosophila and mammals but not in the yeast Saccharomyces cerevisiae. Resembles the initiator (TCAKTY in Drosophila) but functionally distinct from initiator.","xrefs":["PMID:20801935","SO:myl"]},"comments":[],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"TCT element"},{"scope":"exact","value":"polypyrimidine initiator"}],"xrefs":[],"subsets":[],"altIds":[],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0001959/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"},"mostRecent":{"hash":"ad4ec85c0c89dbb861aa2555f482ed98b364db23","shortHash":"ad4ec85","date":"2019-07-31","subject":"Updated location of bacterial_RNApol_promoter and added definitions to child terms lacking definition"},"entries":[{"hash":"ad4ec85c0c89dbb861aa2555f482ed98b364db23","shortHash":"ad4ec85","date":"2019-07-31","subject":"Updated location of bacterial_RNApol_promoter and added definitions to child terms lacking definition"},{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"}]},"parents":["SO:0001660"],"children":[],"ancestors":["SO:0001660","SO:0002309","SO:0001659","SO:0000713","SO:0000714","SO:0001683","SO:0001411","SO:0000001","SO:0000110"],"descendants":[],"relationships":[],"graphNeighborhood":{"parents":["http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001660"],"children":[],"related":[]}},"graph":{"parents":[{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001660","id":"SO:0001660","label":"core_eukaryotic_promoter_element"}],"children":[],"related":[]}}